      "content": "{\n  \"name\": \"dsh-splash-animation\",\n  \"version\": \"0.4.5\",\n  \"description\": \"DSH 开屏动画：自带一个默认视频，装好即可用；也能在设置里换成自己的视频，播完后 0.3 秒渐隐露出界面。清空路径即彻底关闭。\",\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"dsh\",\n    \"dsh-plugin\",\n    \"deepseek-harness\",\n    \"splash\",\n    \"splash-screen\",\n    \"boot-animation\",\n    \"startup-animation\",\n    \"video\",\n    \"mp4\",\n    \"webm\"\n  ],\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"main\": \"./index.js\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": \"./index.js\",\n    \"./client\": \"./client.js\",\n    \"./package.json\": \"./package.json\",\n    \"./cordis.patch.yml\": \"./cordis.patch.yml\"\n  },\n  \"files\": [\n    \"index.js\",\n    \"client.js\",\n    \"assets\",\n    \"cordis.patch.yml\",\n    \"icon.svg\",\n    \"tools/pick-media-file.ps1\",\n    \"README.md\",\n    \"LICENSE\"\n  ],\n  \"//\": \"tools/ 里只有 pick-media-file.ps1 进包：宿主半在运行时按路径读取它来弹原生文件对话框，漏掉它会让文件选择静默降级成只能手输路径。其余 tools/ 是仓库自带的验证脚本，使用者不需要。\",\n  \"icon\": \"./icon.svg\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"verify\": \"node tools/verify-host.mjs && node tools/verify-routes.mjs && node tools/verify-contract.mjs && node tools/verify-install-docs.mjs && node tools/verify-package-contents.mjs\",\n    \"verify:all\": \"npm run verify && npm run verify:http\",\n    \"verify:host\": \"node tools/verify-host.mjs\",\n    \"verify:routes\": \"node tools/verify-routes.mjs\",\n    \"verify:contract\": \"node tools/verify-contract.mjs\",\n    \"verify:install-docs\": \"node tools/verify-install-docs.mjs\",\n    \"verify:package\": \"node tools/verify-package-contents.mjs\",\n    \"verify:http\": \"node tools/verify-http.mjs\"\n  },\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"type\": \"git\",\n    \"url\": \"git+https://github.com/KDDKBD/DeepSeek-splash-animation.git\"\n  },\n  \"bugs\": {\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/KDDKBD/DeepSeek-splash-animation/issues\"\n  },\n  \"homepage\": \"https://github.com/KDDKBD/DeepSeek-splash-animation#readme\",\n  \"publishConfig\": {\n    